 without the banned Elias Baum (counted), Koch is fit again, but Can Uzun came back from international duty with a cold and hessenschau (19 Nov) expects him to miss out, which the numbers don't know. Hoffenheim's defence is thin, with Hajdari, Hranac, Gendrey and De Cat out, and the numbers only count these for Frankfurt's goals through Conte's line, not the defenders; one hessenschau headline (20 Nov) says Hoffenheim have Bambase Conte back, though the numbers take about 11% off their goals for him. Max Burda referees; his short record is just below average and already counted.","goals":{"lean":"higher","adjust_pct":4,"call":"About 3.7 goals","text":"The numbers say 3.6 goals and take about 11% off Hoffenheim for Conte, whom one hessenschau report says is back, while they give Frankfurt nothing for Hoffenheim's four missing defenders. Uzun's likely absence costs Frankfurt some creativity, and Conte's return rests on one source, so I go 4% higher, to about 3.7 (was +2)."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 10.2 corners","text":"The numbers say 10.2 corners, already nudged up for Hoffenheim's recent count (37 in six). A reshuffled Hoffenheim back line may concede more chances but not clearly more corners, and both sides press high rather than camp on the flanks, so I stay at 10.2."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 3.8 cards","text":"The numbers say 3.8 cards, with recent counts, head-to-head and referee Burda's slightly low record already in them. Huetter and Ilzer both expect a high-intensity, aggressive game (Koch calls intensity the key factor), but both teams always play that way and it is in their records, so I stay at 3.8."},"shots":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 28.3 shots","text":"The numbers say 28.3 shots and already add Hoffenheim's recent volume (101 in six, +12%). Their gaps at the back affect chance quality more than the total, and Uzun's absence trims Frankfurt's long-range shooting, so the two roughly cancel and I stay at 28.3."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"higher","adjust_pct":2,"call":"About 10.3 shots on target","text":"The numbers say 10.1 shots on target. Hoffenheim's makeshift defence should give Frankfurt's strikers Ebnoutalib and Burkardt cleaner looks, and Conte may be back up front, partly offset by losing Uzun, so I go 2% higher, to about 10.3 (was 0)."},"sources":["https://www.hessenschau.de/sport/fussball/eintracht-frankfurt/eintracht-frankfurt-empfaengt-hoffenheim-huetter-puzzelt-und-bangt-um-uzun-v1,eintracht-vor-hoffenheim-128.html","https://www.bundesliga.com/en/bundesliga/matchday/2026-2027/10/eintracht-frankfurt-vs-tsg-hoffenheim/liveticker","https://bulinews.com/ilzer-provides-update-conte-after-midweek-injury-setback"],"written_at":"2026-11-21T08:15:00Z"},"league":"bundesliga","take":{"applied":true,"written_at":"2026-11-21T08:15:00Z","goals":{"home":2.108,"away":1.658,"total":3.766,"adjust_pct":4.0,"sized":true,"lean":"higher","home_win":0.472,"draw":0.233,"away_win":0.295,"over":{"1.5":0.902,"2.5":0.726,"3.5":0.52},"over_show":{"1.5":0.902,"2.5":0.726,"3.5":0.52,"4.5":0.326,"5.5":0.179},"btts":0.723,"likely_scores":[{"score":"1-1","p":0.093},{"score":"2-1","p":0.085},{"score":"2-2","p":0.071},{"score":"1-2","p":0.067},{"score":"3-1","p":0.06}],"clean_sheet_home":0.191,"clean_sheet_away":0.121,"range":[2,6],"take_line":{"over":{"line":"1.5","p":0.902,"shown":true},"under":{"line":"5.5","p":0.821,"shown":true}}},"corners":{"home":5.556,"away":4.681,"total":10.237,"adjust_pct":0.0,"sized":true,"lean":"same","over":{"8.5":0.672,"9.5":0.558,"10.5":0.444,"11.5":0.338},"over_show":{"8.5":0.672,"9.5":0.558,"10.5":0.444,"11.5":0.338,"12.5":0.246},"range":[6,15],"take_line":{"over":{"line":"6.5","p":0.861,"shown":false},"under":{"line":"13.5","p":0.828,"shown":false}}},"cards":{"home":1.705,"away":2.103,"total":3.808,"adjust_pct":0.0,"sized":true,"lean":"same","over":{"3.5":0.516,"4.5":0.336,"5.5":0.197},"over_show":{"1.5":0.876,"2.5":0.712,"3.5"